{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find and grab object. Move to target. Check properties. Complete specific task. Scan area if failed.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToTarget    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
    "BT": {
        "Blackboard": [
